      "side": 1,
      "message": "No worries. It seems like I don\u0027t understand completely what\u0027s happening here, as per b/279674820#comment38 . Let\u0027s figure that out first.\n\nI can imagine two solutions:\n\n1. The principled one: add an extra action that writes a single file with the checksum of all glob files and set `restat\u003d1` on it so that if the checksum file doesn\u0027t change, downstream actions don\u0027t get re-run.\n\n2. The hacky one: `touch` the glob files and backdate them.",
      "parentUuid": "4ef65b46_36d271e9",
      "revId": "12270b1029164423d3ef496929273f568498969c",
