        "id": 1002751
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-05-11T16:46:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For option 1, the glob output files are already set to `restat\u003d1`, and are only written by `bpglob` or `soong_build` if their output changes, so I\u0027m not sure how an extra checksum file would help.  The glob files are expected to change in this sequence, because the first analysis is producing a different list of globs than the previous build.\n\nYou could also touch the build.ninja file after writing the globs.\n\nThe other option is to put the glob writing back into `RunBlueprint`.",
      "parentUuid": "fdaca773_1049f1a7",
      "revId": "12270b1029164423d3ef496929273f568498969c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
